WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Welcome to the Man of Recaps.

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:04.600
This is your complete Marvel recap
for The Marvels.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.533
We begin with the first Captain Marvel.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:11.166
We meet an apparently human woman, who's
an elite warrior in the alien Kree empire.

00:00:11.166 --> 00:00:14.433
She has no memory of her past life,
so she thinks her name is Vers.

00:00:14.433 --> 00:00:17.133
The Kree are at war with the evil
shapeshifting Skrulls,

00:00:17.133 --> 00:00:20.433
and during a battle, Vers
crash lands on Earth, back in the 90’s!

00:00:20.433 --> 00:00:22.700
She teams up with SHIELD agent young Nick Fury,

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.400
and fills him in about the Skrull threat.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.633
But soon Vers uncovers the mysteries of
her past...

00:00:26.633 --> 00:00:28.900
she is a human, Carol Danvers.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.000
She was a fighter pilot testing a new super engine

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.900
built with the Tesseract, the Space Stone.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:35.900
But the Kree tried to steal it so Carol crashed, the engine exploded,

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:38.366
and blasted her with super space powers!

00:00:38.366 --> 00:00:40.633
So Carol realizes
the Kree have been lying to her all along,

00:00:40.633 --> 00:00:42.600
and they meet with the Skrull leader
Talos, who's like

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.766
“Yeah, no, they're the bad guys, we're the good guys.”

00:00:44.766 --> 00:00:46.633
So Carol Danvers reclaims her identity,

00:00:46.633 --> 00:00:50.266
changes her uniform from the Kree colors to the good old U.S. Air Force.

00:00:50.266 --> 00:00:53.066
Carol teams up with her old pilot
best friend Maria Rambeau,

00:00:53.066 --> 00:00:54.500
who's got a young daughter, Monica.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.133
They also recruit the cat, Goose,

00:00:56.133 --> 00:00:58.900
who is an alien Flerken, woah! Watch out for that.

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:01.866
And when he scratches Nick Fury’s
eye, yep, that's how he lost it.

00:01:01.866 --> 00:01:03.533
As they fight to stop the Kree invasion, 

00:01:03.533 --> 00:01:06.733
soon Carol realizes the chip they put on her to help control
her powers...

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:08.466
was suppressing her powers!

00:01:08.466 --> 00:01:10.866
She rips it off and oh she's glowing...

00:01:10.866 --> 00:01:12.533
Goes full Super Saiyan!

00:01:12.533 --> 00:01:14.366
Captain Marvel unleashed!

00:01:14.366 --> 00:01:16.700
She flies around in space shooting energy beams,

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:18.966
takes out the whole Kree fleet singlehandedly.

00:01:18.966 --> 00:01:20.366
But Carol can't stick around on Earth,

00:01:20.366 --> 00:01:22.066
she's got to fly off
and keep fighting the Kree.

00:01:22.066 --> 00:01:23.533
But she gives Nick Fury her beeper number,

00:01:23.533 --> 00:01:25.466
like “Hit me up if there’s a real emergency.”

00:01:25.466 --> 00:01:27.900
That emergency happened in Avengers: Infinity War, 

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:30.066
when Thanos snapped away half the population.

00:01:30.066 --> 00:01:31.900
Nick Fury’s last move was to send that text,

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:34.500
so in Avengers: Endgame, Captain Marvel
showed up!

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:36.200
And helped kick Thanos' butt.

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:39.400
Let's do a quick recap on Secret Invasion,
in case any of it comes up.

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:41.766
Nick Fury became good friends
with the Skrull leader Talos,

00:01:41.766 --> 00:01:44.766
but a bad Skrull, Gravik, takes over,
and he wants to conquer Earth,

00:01:44.766 --> 00:01:46.266
and oh! He kills Talos.

00:01:46.266 --> 00:01:48.266
Gravik got the DNA of a bunch of super people,

00:01:48.266 --> 00:01:50.766
wants to put it all in himself
to be the Super Skrull.

00:01:50.766 --> 00:01:52.233
But Talos had a daughter, G’iah,

00:01:52.233 --> 00:01:54.500
and she blasts herself  with the super DNA, too...

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:56.533
so they have a Super Skrull fight!

00:01:56.533 --> 00:01:59.433
The strongest of her powers
is Captain Marvel, So blam!

00:01:59.433 --> 00:02:01.800
Kamehameha! Defeats King Piccolo.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:03.400
Now it's time for Wandavision.

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:05.633
Long story short, Wanda Maximoff, The Scarlet Witch,

00:02:05.633 --> 00:02:09.166
lost control of her powers, and turned this entire small town into a sitcom,

00:02:09.166 --> 00:02:11.033
where she and Vision
could live happily ever after.

00:02:11.033 --> 00:02:14.900
So we follow Agent Monica Rambeau,
yes Maria's daughter from Captain Marvel.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:17.633
She travels into the Hex to find out
what's going on.

00:02:17.633 --> 00:02:20.033
But Wanda soon spots
the imposter and kicks her back out.

00:02:20.033 --> 00:02:21.900
But Monica's not quitting,
she's going in again.

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:24.100
Which the science people warn her
could be real dangerous.

00:02:24.100 --> 00:02:26.500
Indeed, she makes it through,
but it did something weird to her...

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:28.500
Now she's got some super powers!

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:29.933
At the end she's approached by Skrulls,

00:02:29.933 --> 00:02:31.800
who invite her to space for a secret
mission.

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:35.233
They're working with Nick Fury
to build a space station called Saber.

00:02:35.233 --> 00:02:36.933
And now it's time for Ms. Marvel.

00:02:36.933 --> 00:02:40.433
Kamala Khan is a normal teenage girl
who is a Captain Marvel super fan.

00:02:40.433 --> 00:02:42.700
She's going to spice up her cosplay
with her grandma's old bangle...

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:44.733
But when she puts it on, woah what’s this?

00:02:44.733 --> 00:02:46.300
It unlocks her superpowers!

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:49.600
Turns out her grandma was a Djinn,
an interdimensional super person.

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:52.766
Her science friend tells her
that her genes have a “mutation”...

00:02:52.766 --> 00:02:55.566
Yeah the first M-bomb in the MCU!

00:02:55.566 --> 00:02:57.733
Eventually the X-Men are coming!

00:02:57.733 --> 00:03:01.200
But for now Kamala protects Jersey City
as the minor superhero Nightlight,

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.333
and she saves the world from her evil
Djinn Auntie.

00:03:03.333 --> 00:03:06.766
Then her mom sews her a better super suit,
and she learns how to master her powers.

00:03:06.766 --> 00:03:10.666
So she takes a new name from her idol,
Captain Marvel, and becomes Ms. Marvel!

00:03:10.666 --> 00:03:12.400
And in fact they do have
a strange connection,

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:14.700
because at the end
she's teleported away...

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:17.300
She swapped places with Captain Marvel!

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:20.500
So Carol Danvers finds herself
in a teenager's bedroom in New Jersey,

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.633
and The Marvels will pick up there.

00:03:23.466 --> 00:03:25.666
If you like this recap, hit that Subscribe button

00:03:25.666 --> 00:03:28.800
for more of the best recaps of TV and movies.

